WEBVTT

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.976
or if they have any to speak of.

00:02:32.769 --> 00:02:34.110
I meet all kinds of people

00:02:34.134 --> 00:02:36.698
who don't think
they're really good at anything.

00:02:37.253 --> 00:02:41.125
Actually, I kind of divide the world
into two groups now.

00:02:41.149 --> 00:02:44.553
Jeremy Bentham, the great
utilitarian philosopher,

00:02:44.577 --> 00:02:45.976
once spiked this argument.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:48.664
He said, "There are two types
of people in this world:

00:02:48.688 --> 00:02:50.648
those who divide the world into two types

00:02:50.672 --> 00:02:51.848
and those who do not."

00:02:51.872 --> 00:02:54.872
(Laughter)

00:02:57.680 --> 00:02:58.729
Well, I do.

00:02:58.753 --> 00:03:00.753
(Laughter)